computation checks ASCII validity and the structural decimal decoder; the
proved specification then gives the literal standard-string decoding.

Generated from `Certificate.lean` by `Decoding/source/generate.py`. All witnesses
are checked in Lean; generation is not trusted evidence. The relation indices,
word order and multiplicities are exactly those of the shared certificate.
